<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vestorĭus</span></b> , ii, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An artist of Puteoli</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 7, 11
					<i>init.</i></span></i>—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vestorĭā-nus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to Vestorius</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 33,
				13, 57, § 162</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Isid.
				Orig. 19, 17</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A friend of Cicero</i>, Cael. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 8,
				8, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 4, 6, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4,
			16</span></i>, a, 4; 6, 2, 3.</div>
